{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror adventure where reality quietly unravels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ayumi wakes up in a strange library with no memory of how she got there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, she performs her usual duties \u2014 sorting books, maintaining order \u2014 but something isn\u2019t right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality bends, memories resurface, and Ayumi starts to question what is real \u2014 and what the library wants her to remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find the truth, she must explore the corridors and face the secrets hidden deep within the stacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror set in a looping-world environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments inspired by Japanese urban legends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully crafted puzzles that test observation and logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic scares that respond to player choices and actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your decisions</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fairy Cube!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3555930/c6334b92d1fa86c6c9690c961fe121c566f75242.jpg"},{"name":"A Quiet Escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3555930/82f4b3d000e803bb168a74648929ed6587ee056f.jpg"},{"name":"Together, At Last","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3555930/b6a969098f950a52777242a9a36e8e4e4adf98ef.jpg"},{"name":"Best Friend Forever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3555930/f7a33cfaa2e0488d7f4f583acbe55f46eefa4dfc.jpg"},{"name":"Page Turner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3555930/c679985142c2dafadfdb4